# Qt 6.11's QThreadPool synchronization lives in the uninstrumented Qt shared
# library. With ignore_noninstrumented_modules enabled, TSan cannot observe the
# enqueue/dequeue happens-before edge and intermittently reports the inline
# QtConcurrent task constructor racing its inline run method. Keep this narrow:
# the PagedTrackModel page generator and every other application frame remain
# instrumented.
race:QtConcurrent::RunFunctionTaskBase<trackknife::qtmodels::PagedTrackModel::Page>::run
